{"date":"2026-10-08","level":"n4_lite","title":"はじめてのボルダリング教室","text":"きょう、はじめてボルダリング教室に行ってみた。壁を登るのはすごく難しくて、何度も落ちてしまった。でも先生が優しく教えてくれて、ちょっとずつできるようになった。筋肉が痛いけど、すごく楽しかったから、また行きたいと思う。","tokens":[{"surface_form":"きょう","basic_form":"きょう","reading":"きょう","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"はじめて","basic_form":"はじめて","reading":"はじめて","pos":"副詞"},{"surface_form":"ボルダリング","basic_form":"ボルダリング","reading":"ボルダリング","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"教室","basic_form":"教室","reading":"きょうしつ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"に","basic_form":"に","reading":"に","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"行って","basic_form":"行く","reading":"いって","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"みた","basic_form":"みる","reading":"みた","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"。","basic_form":"。","reading":"。","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"壁","basic_form":"壁","reading":"かべ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"を","basic_form":"を","reading":"を","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"登る","basic_form":"登る","reading":"のぼる","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"の","basic_form":"の","reading":"の","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"は","basic_form":"は","reading":"は","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"すごく","basic_form":"すごく","reading":"すごく","pos":"副詞"},{"surface_form":"難しくて","basic_form":"難しい","reading":"むずかしくて","pos":"形容詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"何度","basic_form":"何度","reading":"なんど","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"も","basic_form":"も","reading":"も","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"落ちて","basic_form":"落ちる","reading":"おちて","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"しまった","basic_form":"しまう","reading":"しまった","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"。","basic_form":"。","reading":"。","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"でも","basic_form":"でも","reading":"でも","pos":"接続詞"},{"surface_form":"先生","basic_form":"先生","reading":"せんせい","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"が","basic_form":"が","reading":"が","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"優しく","basic_form":"優しい","reading":"やさしく","pos":"形容詞"},{"surface_form":"教えて","basic_form":"教える","reading":"おしえて","pos":"動詞"},